<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 1997			   1996</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  loss     0.36     vs    profit    0.04</p>
